<title>UK: LME stocks reports cancelled on holidays, May 5, 26.</title>
<headline>LME stocks reports cancelled on holidays, May 5, 26.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange will not release stocks reports on Monday, May 5 and Monday, May 26 due to public holidays, the LME said in a notice.</p>
<p>The LME began daily stock reports on April 7.</p>
